{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226230","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:8:1222623001:1":{"text":"よし、奴が縄を解いて逃げていったぞ。","source_cn":"很好，她成功逃走了，没有辜负我故意弄松的绳索。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57C76516C2DA54D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222623002:0":{"text":"急いで追いかけましょう！本当に逃げられたら、元も子もありませんよ。","source_cn":"我们赶紧追上去吧！万一她真的逃跑，那可得不偿失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C71F647E4D713F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222623003:0":{"text":"ロンロン！ちょっと、ロンロン？ロンロン！","source_cn":"满满——喂……满满，满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD47BD9D7189D9D57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222623004:0":{"text":"グー、グー……","source_cn":"呼噜呼噜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92C3334C14268217","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222623005:1":{"text":"<shk>ロンロン！！</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>满满！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1A3611C6C8DDDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222623006:1":{"text":"わあっ！？ど、どうしたの？もう朝？","source_cn":"啊！嗯？什么！天亮了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B1AF95AE201DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222623007:1":{"text":"おバカロンロン！演技だって言ったでしょ！本当に寝ちゃってどうするのよ！？","source_cn":"满满大笨蛋！说好了是演戏，你怎么真的睡着了呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89B8D9B7F1070E54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222623008:1":{"text":"ご、ごめん！\n最初は寝たふりをしてたんだけど……知らないうちに、その……","source_cn":"对不起！\\n我一开始是装睡……但装着装着，就……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D58C4977E72034A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222623009:1":{"text":"ははっ！気にするな、ボニーは用心深いからな。むしろ本当に眠っていたおかげで疑われなかったのかもしれん。","source_cn":"哈哈哈！没关系。波妮警觉谨慎，你没装睡，而是真的睡着了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6D6AD44CEE48466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222623010:1":{"text":"急いで追うぞ！奴の驚く顔を見るのが楽しみだ。","source_cn":"我们立刻追上去，一定会让她措手不及！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88284A36FFAF283D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:20:12602210:0":{"text":"あなたたちが眠っているうちに、ボニーは拘束を解いて逃げ出した。","source_cn":"趁着你们都睡着，波妮挣脱了束缚跑了。","status":"m